# GW2 Leggy — UI refresh (Aug 2026)

The web UI was rebuilt. **Do not revert to the old look** (large account/armory/craft dashboard cards, tall crafting-progress list cards, 78-item catalog with wrong icons/IDs).

## Current look (source of truth)

- Source: `web/` (Vite + React). Built output: `dist/` → Capacitor Android WebView.
- Styles: `web/src/styles.css` — dark charcoal, gold brand (`Cinzel`), purple tracker badge, compact list rows.
- Main UI: `web/src/App.tsx` — sticky search/filters, category tabs, expansion chips (Core→VoE), gen filters, pin, API key sync.
- Related: `CraftingBreakdown.tsx`, `StashView.tsx` — keep these visually consistent with the compact theme when editing.

## Catalog / icons

- Legendaries live in `web/src/data/legendaries.json` (official GW2 API names, `gw2ItemId`, `defaultIcon`).
- ~99 trackable entries (weapons, armor sets, backs, trinkets, rune/sigil/relic) — **not** the old mismatched 78-item list.
- Prefer API render URLs; don’t reintroduce swapped gen1 IDs/icons from the pre-rebuild bundle.

## After UI changes

```bash
cd web && npm run build   # writes to ../dist
cd .. && npx cap sync android
```

If preview looks like the old “0 / 78” dashboard, hard-refresh — stale JS cache.
